## 5. Technical Architecture (For Reference)

| Component | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Frontend** | React 18 + Vite |
| **Styling** | Vanilla CSS (Flexbox-based modular architecture) |
| **Background Script** | Vanilla JS service worker (Manifest V3) |
| **Build Tool** | Vite (Rolldown) |
| **Storage** | `chrome.storage.sync` (local only) |
| **Notifications** | `chrome.notifications` API |
| **Scheduling** | `chrome.alarms` API |
| **Font** | Google Fonts — Poppins |

